; 80 x 30 mm = 2.40 m against 1.80 m between the plugs, so it hangs. The cord is
; the plug model's own stub of it (its RJ45_Cord jacket, 6.0 mm across, the boot's
; blue), so the rope runs on out of the boot without a step.
[node name="VerletRope" type="VerletRope" parent="."]
